# Agent mold

Work this repo in one thread. Do not open a stacked pull request from an agent run, and do not spawn subagents for mailcrawl tasks.

poteto-mode and pstack apply when those skills are installed. Choose Cursor models.

Privacy stays in force. Real message bodies, subjects, and addresses never go to GitHub. Do not run gog. Do not write to Gmail. Do not call a language model on a crawl path. Fixtures stay synthetic.
